# Great Druid — one of the five Guildlords of the 1997 game, the deck as the original shipped it.
# tier: 11/12 The Guildlords — 35 to 45 life, can't be bribed
# enemy: Great Druid (1997 in-game name, s30/assets/text/Advstrings.txt @CREATURENAMES)
# designer: Coyote Tex, MicroProse designer/producer — every enemy deck (precon page, ref. 2)
# variant: Original (base game; the enemy deck files are dated 19 September 1996)
# source: ../shandalar-src/Decks.zip:Decks/0095.dck "Great Druid (G, 4th)" [Tier 3 — Manalink 3
#   file dated 2016-02-15; its first 13 maindeck lines are the 1997 deck, the 16 lines (60
#   cards) after them are the modern deck Manalink appended and are NOT shipped; its
#   .vNone/.v<Colour> sections are the 1997 colour-keyed swaps]
# source: ../s30/assets/configs/rogues/great_druid.toml (main_cards, sideboard_cards, level 11)
#   [Tier 3 — equals the 1997 prefix above]
# source: ../mage-go/rogue_dck/great_druid.dck [Tier 3 — equals the 1997 prefix]
# cross-check: https://mtg.wiki/page/Shandalar_Enemy_Decks_(Guildlords) — "Morgane - The Great
#   Druid" (Original) [Tier-web — maindeck agrees]
# group: 1997 originals
name: Great Druid
22 Forest
3 Llanowar Elves
3 Gaea's Liege
3 Birds of Paradise
4 Aspect of Wolf
3 Instill Energy
2 Living Lands
3 Stream of Life
3 Untamed Wilds
4 Killer Bees
3 Jayemdae Tome
2 Living Artifact
2 Verduran Enchantress
3 Desert Twister
# The 1997 file's colour-keyed sideboard sections. The AI played the maindeck WITHOUT
# .vNone plus the one section matching the player's deck colour (.vNone by default);
# .vNone is folded into the maindeck above, and SB: holds, per name, the largest
# colour-section count minus the .vNone count — the smallest sideboard from which
# every 1997 configuration can be rebuilt by swapping.
#   .vNone   3 Desert Twister
#   .vBlack  2 Lifeforce, 1 Desert Twister
#   .vBlue   2 Tsunami, 1 Desert Twister
#   .vGreen  1 Desert Twister, 2 Shanodin Dryads
#   .vRed    3 Desert Twister
#   .vWhite  3 Desert Twister
SB: 2 Lifeforce
SB: 2 Tsunami
SB: 2 Shanodin Dryads
